notes:
*These include mainly :-
(i) Children apprehended for begging;
(ii) Children found intoxicated by liquor or dangerous drugs;
(iii) Children indulging in betting or borrowing;
(iv) Children apprehended from brothels;
(v) Children indulging in smoking etc;
(vi) Children having no homes, settled place or visible means of subsistence or having no parents or guardians who could exercise regular and proper guardianship.
†These include offences under the Indian Penal Code, Indian Arms Act, Explosives Act Explosive Substances Act and Habitual Offenders Act, etc.
